hy-judge : List Word → List Word
hy-judge what = list-append (h-line (list-append "Read the " (list-append what " alone, as a reader who has seen nothing else of the document. Ensure it is self-contained with any relevant context included: every reference to another part of the document (this, above, these, a label, a section number) resolved to what it refers to, and any context it leans on stated. Add nothing else and drop nothing. Avik's words stay verbatim: give their context around a quotation, never inside it.")))
  (list-append (h-line "  It is self-contained and makes sense:   hyperactive self-contained")
  (h-line (list-append "  It is not; this is its re-expression:   hyperactive re-expressed < THE " (list-append what " RE-EXPRESSED"))))
